  "description": {
    "about": {
      "items": [
        {
          "items": [
            "Welcome to this stunning beach home located in the desirable Magnolia Creek subdivision in Old Seacrest. With its thoughtfully designed 1st-floor, this spacious retreat offers a haven of comfort and fun for all guests. Whether you're traveling with family or friends, there's ample room for everyone to unwind and recharge in this 3-bedroom, 3.5-bathroom home. Whether you're lounging by the pool, biking to pristine beaches, or exploring the area's top dining and entertainment spots, this home places you right in the heart of it all.<br> <br>Sleeping Arrangements - 1st Floor<br>Bedroom 1: King bed and patio access. Private bathroom with dual sinks and large shower.<br>Bedroom 2: King bed. Private bathroom with tub/shower combo.<br>Bedroom 3: Set of queen-over-queen bunks. Private bathroom with tub/shower combo.<br>Hallway: Built-in set of twin-over-twin bunks.<br>Sleeper sofa in the living room. There are two baby gates installed - one at top of stairs and one at bottom!",
            "Our prices include all fees. No hidden fees."
          ],
          "title": "Stella Blue Seacrest"
        }
      ],
      "title": "About this property"
    },
